{"document_id": 65, "sha256": "daa4cb437041c201ee735c6ca5c33023b867df5c90cc849aaa9a426ff42af299", "agency": "fda", "doc_type": "approval_letter", "program_id": "stelara", "engine": "prep-1.4+docling2.137.0+tables-accurate+repair1+pictables1", "watermarks_removed": 0, "routes": [{"page": 1, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=2246"}, {"page": 2, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=2252"}, {"page": 3, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=394"}, {"page": 4, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=475"}], "blocks": [{"type": "picture", "ref": "#/pictures/0", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [55.5, 699.4, 108.3, 757.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "caption": "", "text": "", "status": "kept", "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/0", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [108.9, 721.5, 359.9, 732.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH AND HUMAN SERVICES", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/1", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 633.3, 156.3, 646.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "BLA 125261/049", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/2", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 536.7, 341.2, 605.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Janssen Biotech, Inc. Attention: Joseph A. Lallier, MS, MBA Associate Director, North American Regulatory Liaison 1400 McKean Road P.O. Box 776", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/3", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 522.9, 195.0, 536.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Spring House, PA 19477", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/4", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 495.3, 154.4, 508.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Dear Mr. Lallier:", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/5", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 440.1, 534.9, 481.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Please refer to your Supplemental Biologics License Application (sBLA), dated August 5, 2011, received August 5, 2011, submitted under section 351 of the Public Health Service Act for Stelara ® (ustekinumab) Injection, 45 mg/0.5 mL and 90 mg/mL Prefilled Syringes.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/6", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 398.7, 529.6, 425.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We acknowledge receipt of your amendments dated September 1, December 2, 7 and 14, 2011; January 11, April 3, 9, 17, 19, May 8 and 23, 2012.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/7", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 357.3, 534.6, 384.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "This \"Prior Approval\" efficacy supplement to your biologics license application proposes to add longer-term safety and efficacy data to the Stelara ® prescribing information.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/8", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 302.1, 536.2, 343.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We have completed our review of this supplemental application, as amended. It is approved, effective on the date of this letter, for use as recommended in the enclosed, agreed-upon labeling text, which includes the following minor editorial revision.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/9", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [108.0, 246.9, 538.5, 287.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "At the end of the \"Malignancies\" subsection under section 6.1, the reference to section 15 \"[see References (15)]\" was deleted and replaced with a superscript \"1\" referring to the specific reference in section 15.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/10", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 219.2, 217.3, 232.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "CONTENT OF LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/11", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 81.3, 537.9, 205.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "As soon as possible, but no later than 14 days from the date of this letter, submit, via the FDA automated drug registration and listing system (eLIST), the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.14(b)] in structured product labeling (SPL) format, as described at http://www.fda.gov/ForIndustry/DataStandards/StructuredProductLabeling/default.htm, that is identical to the enclosed labeling (text for the package insert, Medication Guide) and include the labeling changes proposed in any pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements. Information on submitting SPL files using eLIST may be found in the guidance for industry titled \"SPL Standard for Content of Labeling Technical Qs and As\" at http://www.fda.gov/downloads/Drugs/GuidanceComplianceRegulatoryInformation/Guidances/U", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/12", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [419.4, 681.5, 552.5, 692.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Food and Drug Administration", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/13", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [419.4, 670.0, 527.5, 681.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Silver Spring MD 20993", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/14", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [388.4, 619.4, 540.0, 632.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/15", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [18.0, 15.9, 121.4, 25.2], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 3137522", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/16", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 744.7, 142.3, 755.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 125261/049", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/17", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 733.1, 99.0, 744.2], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "Page 2", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/18", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 682.5, 496.9, 709.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "CM072392.pdf. For administrative purposes, please designate this submission \"Product Correspondence - Final SPL for approved BLA STN 125261/049.\"", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/19", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 613.6, 525.6, 668.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Also within 14 days, amend all pending supplemental applications for this BLA, including pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements, for which FDA has not yet issued an action letter, with the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.12(f)] in MS Word format that includes the changes approved in this supplemental application.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/20", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 586.0, 412.1, 599.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "The SPL will be accessible via publicly available labeling repositories.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/21", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 558.3, 295.9, 571.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/22", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 475.6, 524.1, 544.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Under the Pediatric Research Equity Act (PREA) (21 U.S.C. 355c), all applications for new active ingredients, new indications, new dosage forms, new dosing regimens, or new routes of administration are required to contain an assessment of the safety and effectiveness of the product for the claimed indication(s) in pediatric patients unless this requirement is waived, deferred, or inapplicable.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/23", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 434.2, 533.0, 461.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Because none of these criteria apply to your supplemental application, you are exempt from this requirement.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/24", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 406.5, 240.9, 419.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/25", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 268.6, 537.9, 392.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "You may request advisory comments on proposed introductory advertising and promotional labeling. To do so, submit, in triplicate, a cover letter requesting advisory comments, the proposed materials in draft or mock-up form with annotated references, and the package insert(s) to: Food and Drug Administration Center for Drug Evaluation and Research Office of Prescription Drug Promotion 5901-B Ammendale Road Beltsville, MD 20705-1266", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/26", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 185.8, 535.2, 254.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "As required under 21 CFR 601.12(f)(4), you must submit final promotional materials, and the package insert(s), at the time of initial dissemination or publication, accompanied by a Form FDA 2253. For instruction on completing the Form FDA 2253, see page 2 of the Form. For more information about submission of promotional materials to the Office of Prescription Drug Promotion (OPDP), see http://www.fda.gov/AboutFDA/CentersOffices/CDER/ucm090142.htm.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["PROMOTIONAL MATERIALS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/27", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 158.1, 246.3, 171.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "REPORTING REQUIREMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/28", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 116.8, 513.3, 143.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We remind you that you must comply with reporting requirements for an approved BLA (in 21 CFR 600.80 and in 21 CFR 600.81).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/29", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [18.0, 15.9, 121.4, 25.2], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 3137522", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/30", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 744.7, 142.3, 755.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 125261/049", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/31", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 733.1, 99.0, 744.2], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "Page 3", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/32", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 696.3, 520.2, 709.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "If you have any questions, call Paul Phillips, Regulatory Project Manager, at (301) 796-3935.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/33", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [279.0, 668.7, 327.4, 682.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Sincerely,", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/34", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [279.0, 641.1, 480.6, 654.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "{See appended electronic signature page}", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["{See appended electronic signature page}"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/35", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [279.0, 558.4, 500.1, 626.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Susan J. Walker, MD, FAAD Director Division of Dermatology and Dental Products Office of Drug Evaluation III Center for Drug Evaluation and Research", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["{See appended electronic signature page}"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/36", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [72.0, 503.2, 186.7, 530.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "ENCLOSURES: Content of Labeling", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["{See appended electronic signature page}"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/37", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [18.0, 15.9, 121.4, 25.2], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 3137522", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/38", "parent": "#/body", "page": 4, "bbox": [43.4, 735.9, 567.9, 749.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["{See appended electronic signature page}"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/39", "parent": "#/body", "page": 4, "bbox": [43.4, 686.9, 505.2, 730.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "This is a representation of an electronic record that was signed electronically and this page is the manifestation of the electronic signature.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["{See appended electronic signature page}"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/40", "parent": "#/body", "page": 4, "bbox": [43.4, 667.9, 567.9, 681.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["{See appended electronic signature page}"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/41", "parent": "#/body", "page": 4, "bbox": [43.4, 652.5, 56.1, 663.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "/s/", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["{See appended electronic signature page}"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/42", "parent": "#/body", "page": 4, "bbox": [43.4, 636.5, 251.2, 647.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "------